1. Introduction

[Your NFT Collection Name] is a limited collection of 3,000 unique digital artworks built on the Base blockchain.
Each NFT represents a verified digital asset designed for collectors, investors, and community members who value rarity, art, and blockchain ownership.

The collection introduces a rarity-based system that connects long-term holders to future rewards, ecosystem benefits, and exclusive airdrops.

2. Project Concept

Our vision is to merge art, technology, and community engagement into a sustainable on-chain ecosystem.
The collection consists of three rarity tiers — Common, Rare, and Legendary — each tied to different benefits and future utility.

The ultimate goal is to build an evolving NFT ecosystem that extends beyond collectibles, offering access to token rewards, staking options, and community-driven governance.

3. Rarity System

The collection is composed of 3,000 NFTs divided into three rarity categories:

Tier	Quantity	Description
Legendary	100	Ultra-rare pieces with unique traits and exclusive access to premium rewards
Rare	500	Distinct artworks offering mid-tier benefits
Common	2,400	Core collection items with community-level utilities

Rarity is algorithmically defined and verifiable on-chain to ensure transparency and fairness in distribution.

4. Utility

NFT holders gain access to the following benefits:

Future Airdrops: Holders receive token or NFT rewards based on rarity.

Exclusive Access: Early entry to new drops, collaborations, and events.

Governance Rights: Ability to vote on project developments and community proposals.

Marketplace Royalties: Revenue share mechanisms may be introduced for long-term holders.

